The '''Legend Capsule''' is a type of [[Cat Capsule]] that works almost identically to [[Platinum Capsules (Gacha Event)|Platinum Capsules]], but has a 5.3% chance to drop a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare]] and a 94.7% chance to drop an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]]. To enter this Gacha, the player requires a Legend Ticket, which can be obtained by buying it with real currency via a special sale for $7.99/¥980, clearing all [[The Aku Realms]] stages for the first time (only in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]], in other versions a Platinum Ticket is given instead), clearing the [[Rank-Up Test 3 (Rank 12)|final stage]] of [[Catclaw Championships]] Rank 12 for the first time, beating [[Filibuster Invasion (Cats of the Cosmos)/Outbreak|Filibuster Invasion Outbreak]] and from reaching 25000, or 30000 [[User Rank]]. A Legend Ticket was also given as a login stamp during BCJP and BCEN's [[Anniversary/10th Year|10th Anniversary]].

Just like Platinum Capsules, this event is completely unconnected to any ongoing Rare Cat Capsule events; ergo, the chances of getting a unit from a particular set does not change with the Rare Capsule set rotation.

